- Cursor strong model owns planning and replanning.
- Explicitly invoke the reasoning pattern from `best-minds` when architecture, safety, or strategy tradeoffs are non-obvious.
- For planning outputs, update `.ai-pair/current_handoff.md`, `.ai-pair/task_board.md`, and `.ai-pair/status.json`.
- Do not implement business code during the planning phase.
